# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:1
msgid "Epicycle"
msgstr "Episykli"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:12
msgid "Harmonics"
msgstr "Harmoniset"

# (auto-translated)
#: ../hacks/config/epicycle.xml.h:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"A pre-heliocentric model of planetary motion.\n"
"\n"
"This draws the path traced out by a point on the edge of a\n"
"circle.  That circle rotates around a point on the rim of another\n"
"circle, and so on, several times.\n"
"\n"
"The geometry of epicycles was perfected by Hipparchus of Rhodes at some "
"time\n"
"around 125 B.C., 185 years after the birth of Aristarchus of Samos, the\n"
"inventor of the heliocentric universe model.  Hipparchus applied epicycles "
"to\n"
"the Sun and the Moon.  Ptolemy of Alexandria went on to apply them to what "
"was\n"
"then the known universe, at around 150 A.D.  Copernicus went on to apply "
"them\n"
"to the heliocentric model at the beginning of the sixteenth century.  "
"Johannes\n"
"Kepler discovered that the planets actually move in elliptical orbits in "
"about\n"
"1602.  The inverse-square law of gravity was suggested by Boulliau in 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newton's Principia Mathematica was published in 1687, and proved that\n"
"Kepler's laws derived from Newtonian gravitation.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Written by James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Esiheliosentrinen planeettojen liikkeen malli.\n"
"\n"
"Tämä piirtää polun, jonka jäljittää pisteen a reunalla\n"
"ympyrä.  Tämä ympyrä pyörii toisen reunassa olevan pisteen ympäri\n"
"ympyrä ja niin edelleen useita kertoja.\n"
"\n"
"Rodoksen Hipparkhos viimeisteli episyklien geometrian jossain vaiheessa\n"
"noin 125 eaa., 185 vuotta Aristarkoksen Samoksen syntymän jälkeen,\n"
"heliosentrinen universumimallin keksijä.  Hipparkhos sovelsi episykliä\n"
"aurinko ja kuu.  Ptolemaios Aleksandrialainen jatkoi soveltaen niitä siihen, "
"mikä oli\n"
"sitten tunnettu maailmankaikkeus, noin vuonna 150 jKr. Kopernikus jatkoi "
"niiden soveltamista\n"
"heliosentriseen malliin 1500-luvun alussa.  Johannes\n"
"Kepler havaitsi, että planeetat liikkuvat elliptisellä kiertoradalla noin\n"
"1602. Painovoiman käänteisen neliön lain ehdotti Boulliau vuonna 1645.\n"
"Isaac Newtonin Principia Mathematica julkaistiin vuonna 1687, ja se todisti "
"sen\n"
"Keplerin lait perustuvat Newtonin gravitaatioon.\n"
"\n"
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deferent_and_epicycle\n"
"\n"
"Kirjoittaja James Youngman; 1998.\n"
"  "

